      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>opsgenieConfigs defines the list of OpsGenie configurations.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
