      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>dismissText</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>dismissText defines the label for the cancel button in the dialog. When not specified, defaults to "Cancel". This button cancels the action.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>okText</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>okText defines the label for the confirmation button in the dialog. When not specified, defaults to "Okay". This button proceeds with the action.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>text</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>text defines the main message displayed in the confirmation dialog. This should be a clear question or statement asking the user to confirm their action.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>title</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>title defines the title text displayed at the top of the confirmation dialog. When not specified, a default title will be used.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      </TableBody>
      </Table>
