      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>useFIPSSTSEndpoint</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>boolean</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>useFIPSSTSEndpoint defines the FIPS mode for the AWS STS endpoint. It requires Prometheus &gt;= v2.54.0.</TableCell>
